   "widgets_values": [
    "**This group (Veo 3.1, cloud API, UNTESTED):** first + last frame to video via the ComfyUI partner node. Costs credits per shot (comfy.org account, sign in). Short shots: set the Director's `seconds` to the engine minimum (Seedance 4 s, Kling 3 s, Veo 4 s). No GPU needed. Results differ on every call, the seed does not fix them."
   ],
